SUMMARY:Forty Elephants Vintage & Handmade Holiday Kitschmas Market
DESCRIPTION:Forty Elephant’s 16th annual kitschy holiday market is the weekend before Thanksgiving at Double Tree Resort. Featuring 85 curated vendors with everything for your vintage lifestyle! Shop vintage clothing & decor\, flea market finds\, and quirky & vintage-vibe makers. It’s the perfect place to find gifts for family and friends – or a little something for yourself. Admission and parking for the holiday market is free with handicap spaces available.  \n\n\n\n VENDOR APPLICATION https://forms.gle/Rt8sBxo5ETiV1GBPA Follow us Facebook & Instagram @FortyElephantsMarket for vendor previews and more information. \n\n\n\n\n    Learn More
