SUMMARY:Pocket Books Friends and Family Feast
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a feast prepared for you by our Cookbook Club using recipes from A FEATHER AND A FORK by Crystal Wahpepah. Please RSVP below so we have an accurate headcount! Suggested donation at the door of $25 for one plate and 5 raffle ticket. Proceeds will go to our local Conestoga-Susquehannock tribal council. \n\nThe buffet-style meal will be set up to allow you to fill a take-out container with all the food you’d like\, to take to go or eat on the porch. Note that food will be set up upstairs in our events room\, but if the stairs are inaccessible to you we are happy to make a plate for you.\n\nIf you would like to join Cookbook Club in preparing food for this feast\, you must (1) purchase the cookbook A FEATHER AND A FORK from Pocket Books (use code COOKCLUB for 10% off!) and (2) sign up for a dish or two on this spreadsheet by 10/31. \n            \n        \n                \n            \n                \n                \n    Learn More
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/pocket-books-friends-and-family-feast/
LOCATION:Pocket Books Shop\, 903 Wheatland Ave\, Lancaster\, Pennsylvania\, 17603\, United States
CATEGORIES:Community
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/10/feather-n-fork.avif
ORGANIZER;CN="Pocket Books Shop":MAILTO:info@pocketbooksshop.com
END:VEVENT
