SUMMARY:PASS the AUX: Influences
DESCRIPTION:Presented by PH Makes an F Sound & SRCC. PASS the AUX returns to The Lounge at Hempfield Apothetique with the theme INFLUENCES. Live hiphop sets from spectacular rapper/producer GMS\, breakbeat Queen the BJEWELLED\, recording artist Theo Isaacs\, incredible vocalist Kris Boston\, and OliLew+AMFH. benOAKS hosts a live beat making session with special guest rappers and/or singers\, and Shawn Kniesley paints live throughout the event. Theo Isaacs and Kris Boston are sharing their new music. The last hour is open aux with an open cypher; signups begin at 2pm.  \n\n\n\nAdmission is FREE; donations to the artists and buying merch are highly recommended. 21+. Legal hemp consumption lounge\, no medical card required\, BYOB. \n\n\n\n\n    Learn More
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/pass-the-aux-influences/
LOCATION:The Lounge at Hempfield Apothetique\, 100 West Walnut Street\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17603\, United States
