SUMMARY:Kids Super Secret Gift Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Shhh… it’s a surprise! In this special drop-off workshop just for kids\, we’ll spend 3.5 fun-filled hours crafting five unique handmade gifts for family and friends. These will be all new and improved crafts from last year’s workshops. \n\n\n\n Monday’s workshop will be for kids in 1st – 4th gradesTuesday’s workshop will be for 5th – 8th graders.  \n\n\n\nThe gifts will all be the same\, just slightly altered to be simpler or more complex based on the age grouping. Can’t make the workshop for your child’s age\, or want to put siblings in the same workshop? No problem! We are not militant about the age groups – we will happily offer age-appropriate variations to any child who is younger or older than the rest of the group. We’ll keep everything top secret so kids can surprise their loved ones with something special they made all by themselves! Snacks will be provided\, so please let us know when signing up if your child has any food allergies. When signing up\, also let us know for which occasion these gifts will be given so we can help tailor the details. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n    Register Now
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/kids-super-secret-gift-workshop/
LOCATION:The Felted Fox\, 2029 Miller Rd.\, East Petersburg\, PA\, 17520\, United States
CATEGORIES:Education & Classes
END:VEVENT
