SUMMARY:"The Family Recipe" Screening and Q&A at Penn Cinema
DESCRIPTION:Winner of four Best Feature Film awards\, The Family Recipe is a fun ensemble comedy about family\, tradition\, and the beautiful chaos that comes with bringing everyone together under one roof.As Thanksgiving approaches\, Alison is determined to host the perfect holiday dinner. But between clashing personalities\, long-held grudges\, awkward relatives\, and one mishap after another\, perfection quickly slips out of reach. Filled with warmth\, humor\, and recognizable family moments\, The Family Recipe celebrates the messy traditions that somehow keep families coming back to the table year after year.Trailer \n\n\n\n\n    get tickets
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/the-family-recipe-screening-and-qa-at-penn-cinema/
LOCATION:Penn Cinema\, 541 Airport Rd\, Lititz\, PA\, 17543\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/11/7.0-THE-FAMILY-RECIPE-POSTER-smallest.avif
END:VEVENT
