SUMMARY:LANCASTER COUNTY’S CHRISTMAS TOUR
DESCRIPTION:Put the HO! HO! HO! back into holiday shopping on this one-of-a-kind holiday shopping/food and fun adventure featuring 19 amazing stops! Set up like a home or garden tour\, you’ll travel place to place\, in your own vehicle\, enjoying all the special free things (refreshments\, games\, gifts\, farm tours\, demos\, workshop tours\, make & take projects\, etc) the businesses have planned for you. Your ticket is valid the entire time—do what you can in a day or take 10 days—it’s up to you. Collect a stamp at each location and enter to win 1 of 2 $475 shopping sprees! Plus\, each place is offering a valuable coupon to use during the tour!  \n\n\n\nAlthough we don’t tell the names of the businesses ahead of time (that’s part of the fun secret!)\, we will tell some of the things tour goers will see . . . gifts\, gifts\, and more gifts—something for everyone on your list!\, handmade artisan shops\, a leather crafter\, tucked-away greenhouses\, curated essential healing oils and body products\, craft shops\, a country market\, mouth-watering eateries including one in an actual train car\, candles\, jewelry\, books\, clothing and so much more!  \n\n\n\nThe stops are located in the Kinzers\, Paradise\, Strasburg\, Lampeter\, Bird in Hand\, and Intercourse areas—easy to do in a day (if you so choose). What a fun way to shop for the holidays! Tickets are $12 ea–$1 per ticket is donated to Chestnut Housing. Your ticket is a booklet which contains a guide that lists the name\, address and description of each business\, a map to get you around\, the calendar of extra events\, tree-stamping game entry form and coupons from every business. Call 717-721-9409 or go to www.bestkeptsecretstour.com  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n    Learn More
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/lancaster-countys-christmas-tour/
LOCATION:PA
CATEGORIES:Community
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/10/Shopping-ladies-autumn.avif
END:VEVENT
