SUMMARY:Handmade Holiday Market at Gallery Grow
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a very special holiday weekend at Gallery Grow! Shop a thoughtfully curated selection of local artists\, one-of-a-kind handmade gifts\, and unique vintage finds. Discover something unexpected\, support local creatives\, and find a few special treasures for your holiday giving. Friday\, December 4 | 5–8 PM Saturday\, December 5 | 12–4 PM Celebrate the season\, shop small\, and discover something special at Gallery Grow! \n\n\n\n\n    Learn More
