SUMMARY:Prohibition Repeal Party
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the end of Prohibition at the Log Cabin’s annual Prohibition Repeal Party! Enjoy an evening of heavy hors d’oeuvres\, live music\, and a best-dressed contest\, along with Roaring ’20s-inspired cocktails and festive drinks available for purchase. Join us as we celebrate 93 years of legal operations. Formal and festive attire encouraged! Tickets: $35 online / $45 at the door. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n    Learn More
