SUMMARY:Strasburg Holiday Home Tour
DESCRIPTION:Get in the Christmas spirit\, enjoy historic homes\, and get some ideas for decorating your own! The Strasburg Heritage Society’s 15th annual Holiday Home Tour! \n\n\n\nThe homes on this year’s tour are all at least a century old\, and some are much more. Half of the homes will be in town\, within easy walking distance of each other\, while the other half showcase wonderful properties all around the Strasburg vicinity. At our Event Center (First Presbyterian Church\, 101 S. Decatur Street)\, tour tickets\, lunch\, craft vendors\, and fresh holiday greens will be available. You are welcome to visit the Event Center even if you don’t purchase a ticket for the tour.  \n\n\n\nTickets will cost $30 on the day of the tour\, but can be purchased anytime from November 7 to December 4 for $25. Advance tickets can be purchased in person at Main Street Antiques (2 W. Main St.) or Speckled Hen Coffee (141 E. Main St.)\, as well as online at StrasburgHeritageSociety.org under the Events tab. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n    Buy Tickets
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/strasburg-holiday-home-tour/
LOCATION:First Presbyterian Church\, Strasburg\, 101 S. Decatur St.\, Strasburg\, PA\, 17579\, United States
CATEGORIES:Festivals & Annual Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/10/Adobe-Express-file.avif
ORGANIZER;CN="Strasburg Heritage Society":MAILTO:StrasburgHolidayTour@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
